<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Impath started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Impath started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Ken Bohringer has started coverage of Impath Inc with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the company closed on Tuesday at 19. Impath is a provider of cancer analyses.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
